# Project rules

Read `AGENTS.md` before editing. It is authoritative for the current route tree, features, providers, API clients, commands, and agent safety. Use `CONVENTIONS.md` for detailed style.

- Expo 57 / React Native 0.86.3 / TypeScript strict; Yarn only.
- Preserve unrelated changes and never edit `.env`.
- Reuse shared components and Unistyles theme tokens.
- Keep en, vi, zh-CN, and zh-TW synchronized.
- React Query owns remote state; Zustand selectors own shared client state; auth stays in `useAuthStore`.
- Match neighboring services when choosing among the repository's Axios clients.
- No `any`, suppression directives, hardcoded colors, or `--no-verify`.
- Run `yarn validate` before handoff and relevant tests for behavior changes.
- Never commit, push, publish OTA updates, or deploy/build releases unless explicitly requested.
